From: ggbdpq <ggbdpq@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:01:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gateway: a legacy compact carrying a recorded seal is judged
 here, the writer answering it

What changed: codexBackend's /responses/compact broke to the relay before
any seal check ("preserve native compaction's existing passthrough"): a
compact whose input carries a compaction magpie recorded the writer of
reached the sign-in as it came, and a seal of another account's is
refused there, its reason unread (#2727). The compact is now judged at
its passthrough (sealedCompact): the writer on in magpie answers it,
signed as the writer (codexUpstreamOn) - a pause of the sign-in
(compactOn) changes the signature, not the judgment, so a seal judged on
the /responses path is judged here too; a writer gone (signed out,
lapsed, paused, switched off, kept from the model) is refused with
checkpointError's words, the same the same request on /responses gets
(serve, checkpointReaders). What goes as it came: a seal the sign-in
wrote while it can be asked (the backend takes its own), a seal a magpie
key's candidate wrote, a request signing with its own chatgpt-account-id
(a Codex on WSL or another CODEX_HOME - codexServed's caution), and a
provider or sign-in state magpie cannot read - a failed read relays,
never refuses. Whether the writer can be asked is checkpointGone's walk:
gone, its answer is the reason; on and serving the seal's model, its
answer is checkpointNotRouted, its own words for a healthy writer.

Run: TestNativeCompactionCompactJudgesItsWriter, seven subtests - the
writer on answers signed as itself (the backend sees its account id), a
gone writer refused with its reason, the sign-in's own seal, a key's
seal and a request naming another account relayed as it came, and the
compactOn path judged both ways - are red on upstream/main 992f288e for
the three behavior changes (relayed to the sign-in, its account id on
the backend) and green with the change; -race -count=3 green. Ablation:
codex_backend.go restored to upstream/main with the tests kept, the same
three fail again. Mutations: the gone classifier inverted (five red, the
healthy answers among them) and the chatgpt-account-id skip dropped (its
subtest red). TestNativeCompaction family green; targeted regression
(NativeCompaction|Compact|Checkpoint|TestCodex|ProxyDown) green; full
internal/gateway suite green (323s). gofmt -l clean. go vet ./... and
linux/windows vet green (the known trayimage cgo warning aside);
darwin/linux/windows builds green.

